<view class="ui-page complete-page"><text class="ui-kicker">元享 · 试用履约</text><text class="ui-title">把好物，寄到你身边。</text><text class="ui-lead">仅限中选用户填写，请核对本次活动的收货资料。</text><button class="ui-secondary native-address" bindtap="yx35PickAddress" disabled="{{busy}}"><yx-icon name="location" tone="ink" size="36"/> 从微信选择地址</button><view class="manual-note">也可以在下方手动填写或修改</view>
 <form bindsubmit="save"><view class="ui-card complete-form"><view><text>收件人</text><input name="username" value="{{yx35Name}}" maxlength="45" placeholder="请填写收件人姓名" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view><text>联系电话</text><input name="tel" value="{{yx35Tel}}" maxlength="25" placeholder="请填写有效联系方式" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view class="address-field"><text>收货地址</text><textarea name="address" value="{{yx35Address}}" maxlength="250" placeholder="省市区、街道及门牌号" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="ui-error">{{error}}</view><button form-type="submit" class="ui-primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy||submissionUnknown||!id}}">{{submissionUnknown?'请先核对提交结果':busy?'正在提交':'保存并提交'}}</button></form><navigator wx:if="{{submissionUnknown}}" class="ui-secondary complete-records" open-type="redirect" url="/sage_dksy/pages/user/trial_list">查看试用申请记录</navigator><text class="complete-note">请填写本人授权提供的信息。资料用于本次活动履约。</text>
</view>
